body:
I was feeling really sorry for myself due to the quarantine, didn’t want to get up early and get my work done. Thanks to this app I’m beginning to see change little and often, my mood has improved and overall I’m feeling healthier and happier. It can be difficult to tick off habits though as there is so much on the home screen. Might be easier to just have one page specifically for ticking off completed habits , without the “routine” section. 

Thanks guys! 

@hglly
